Read the clock, sleep for 0.5 seconds, and read the clock again,
and verify that approximately 0.5 seconds actually passed.  A bug
in gettimeofday() on aarch64 (64-bit ARM) returned bad values
and failed this test.

See https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1479588
and https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1451467
